    <briefdescription>
<para>Simple AIMD congestion controller for per-connection rate adaptation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements a TCP-like AIMD (Additive Increase / Multiplicative Decrease) algorithm:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Slow start: window doubles each RTT until <computeroutput>ssthresh_bytes</computeroutput> is reached.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Congestion avoidance: window increases by MSS per RTT.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>On packet loss: ssthresh = window / 2; window = ssthresh.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-safe via an internal mutex. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
